本組原文及身份互校。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"31b_fd1_f77","source_assertion_id":"a-xuanmo-qi-kuan-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-027","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo","source_id":"s-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo-ws1508012","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001","quote":"瞻兄寬，宋世與瞻竝為方伯，至是瞻雖坐事，而寬位待如舊也。寬泰始初為隨郡，值西方反，父玄謨在都，寬棄郡歸，明帝加賞，使隨張永討薛安都。寬辭以母猶存，在西為賊所執，請得西行。遂襲破隨郡，斬偽太守劉師念，拔其母。事平，明帝嘉之，使圖畫寬形。建元初，為散騎常侍、光祿大夫，領前軍將軍。永明元年，為太常。坐於宅殺牛，免官。後為光祿大夫。三年，卒。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0042","source_term":"父玄謨"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"在建鄴／在都者為寬父玄謨。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-nanshi-016-wangxuanmo-heirs-ws1963381","work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-016","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-016-wangxuanmo-heirs","raw_mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-nanshi-016-wangxuanmo-heirs:p002:m0001","c-nanshi-016-wangxuanmo-heirs:p002:m0005"],"paragraph_ids":["c-nanshi-016-wangxuanmo-heirs:p002"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanshi-016-wangxuanmo-heirs:p002:m0001","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-016-wangxuanmo-heirs:p002:m0001"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanshi-016-wangxuanmo-heirs:p002:m0005","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-016-wangxuanmo-heirs:p002:m0005"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":2,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":2,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"2處獨立位置，2個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"},{"source_id":"s-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-heirs-ws1997726","work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-076","chapter_id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-heirs","raw_mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-heirs:p001:m0064","c-songshu